### cua_repl Chrome app API 跑坑（NEW）
- `cua.createBrowserTab("iab", ...)` 失败："Browser is not available: iab"
- `cua.listBrowsers()` / `cua.listTabs()` 返回空
- 但 `cua.getApp("Google Chrome")` 能拿到 Chrome app + AX tree
- `ch.pressKey(null, "Return")` 内部 throw `Cannot read properties of null (reading '"'trim')"'` — null 走不通
- `ch.pressKey(9, "Return")` throw `e.key.trim is not a function` — 数字 index 走不通
- `ch.pressKey("Return")`（App API 应只接 key）OK 但只在 focused element 才对
- `ch.typeText(null, text)` / `ch.typeText(9, text)` 同样 throw trim 错 — typeText 必需要 valid element
- `ch.paste(text)` OK！可以绕过 address bar — 用 cmd+L 聚焦 → paste → pressKey("Return") 才能真 navigate
- 实战可用流程：cmd+L → paste(url) → pressKey("Return") → 等 8-10s → getAXState

